sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as Go API
  participant R as Redis
  participant E as Embedding provider
  participant P as PostgreSQL

  C->>A: POST /search or /context + JWT
  A->>R: GET search:hash(full request + auth)
  alt cache hit
    R-->>A: JSON response
    A-->>C: cached=true
  else cache miss
    par semantic signal
      A->>E: embed query
      A->>P: pgvector cosine top 50
    and keyword signal
      A->>P: PostgreSQL FTS top 50
    and entity signal
      A->>P: facts by entity overlap
    end
    Note over A,P: semantic failure is skipped; org_id scopes all queries
    A->>A: RRF fusion + ranking + diversity
    A->>A: token budget or top-K
    A->>R: SET TTL 5m + ZINCRBY popular query
    A-->>C: results
  end
